# questions/pi/extreme 240x60 @0,44 (240x15)
╭─ Where stored? ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│  Where should a session's full transcript, every tool result and each compaction summary be kept once a run ends?                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              │
│▸ ○ 1  SQLite in the repository, beside the worktrees                                                                       ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐                                      │
│       One file the checkout can delete, and no service to keep running on any of the machines.                             │   create table if not exists event (                                     │                                      │
│  ○ 2  Postgres beside the application, shared by every machine                                                             │     id integer primary key,                                              │                                      │
│       One more service to run, back up and keep reachable from a laptop that is often offline.                             │     session text not null,                                               │                                      │
│  ○ 3  Type something.                                                                                                      │     at text not null,                                                    │                                      │
│                                                                                                                            │     body json not null                                                   │                                      │
│  ✎ Add a note (n).                                                                                                         │   ) strict;                                                              │                                      │
│                                                                                                                            │                                                                          │                                      │
│                                                                                                                            │ A row per event, so the history is the table and a reader can replay it. │                                      │
│                                                                                                                            └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              │
